OL,3,GNEWSAHot summers and soaring bills
OL,4,Aputting soft play centres at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey are the indoor centres of fun that
OL,7,Fare perfect for an energetic play date.
OL,9,FBut the owner of one soft play business
OL,10,Fsays it is in danger of closure as the
OL,11,Fhot summer has meant she struggled to
OL,12,Fget people through the doors.
OL,14,FJessica Harvey has run Funzone in
OL,15,FWhitchurch for over a year, and said as
OL,16,Fthe industry is seasonal, there were
OL,17,Foccasions when she was the only one
OL,18,Fthere all day.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
