OL,3,GNEWSAHot summers and soaring bills
OL,4,Aputting soft play centres at risk
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Over the summer, there has definitely
OL,7,Fbeen [times] where we probably had 10
OL,8,Fto 15 people in all week, which just
OL,9,Fisn't sustainable," she said.
